.TH smi-docker-prepare "1" "November 2026" "SMI Toolset" "SMI Docker Command"
.SH NAME
smi-docker-prepare \- Prepare the local build environment for Docker
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-docker-prepare
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-docker-prepare
is the first step of the Docker build process of the toolset:
.BR smi-docker-prepare ,
.BR smi-docker-build (1),
.BR smi-docker-push (1).
It sources the \fBdocker.sh\fR library and the \fBbuild.sh\fR script of the current directory, and
runs its \fBdocker_prepare\fR function, for the steps needed before the build, for example
gathering artifacts into the build context.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./build.sh
Defines \fBdocker_prepare\fR.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
The whole process, from the directory of \fBbuild.sh\fR:
.RS
.nf
smi-docker-prepare
smi-docker-build
smi-docker-push
.fi
.RE
.SH AUTHOR
.PP
Command written by Imre Tabur.
.SH "REPORTING BUGS"
.PP
